      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T20:31:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The documentation mention that getUidImportance and getPackageImportance has the same permission.\n\nYes but they have different in handling INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS_FULL between \n\n- getUidImportance -\u003e getUidProcessState\n- getPackageImportance -\u003e getPackageImportance",
      "parentUuid": "84290f90_948a1259",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 717,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 717,
